# Larval Scoutlander, "a land or Lander" and "up to two" (CR 701.23d): Bot1's Galactic Wayfarer makes a Lander token (an artifact, not a land). Sacrificing it lets Bot1
# search; the library has just the one basic land, a Forest, so only that is found (fewer than two) and it enters tapped. Bot1 has no land to sacrifice, so only the Lander is offered.

